  <data key="d2">Noah Carter used carbon-fiber spikes to enhance performance during the race." So the relationship is between a person and a product. In this case, maybe the relationships are between methods and processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Noah Carter used carbon-fiber spikes to enhance performance during the race." So in this case, the relationship is between the person and the product. Similarly, here, the SDM (if considered a Technology) is used to calculate the event times. So maybe the relationship is between SDM and the events.</data>
